Posición: Backend Web Developer (Drupal)
Location: Córdoba

Join Our Team

Oowlish, one of Latin America's rapidly expanding software development companies, is seeking experienced technology professionals to enhance our diverse and vibrant team.

As a valued member of Oowlish, you will collaborate with premier clients from the United States and Europe, contributing to pioneering digital solutions. Our commitment to creating a nurturing work environment is recognized by our certification as a Great Place to Work, where you will have opportunities for professional development, growth, and a chance to make a significant international impact.

We offer the convenience of remote work, allowing you to craft a work-life balance that suits your personal and professional needs. We're looking for candidates who are passionate about technology, proficient in English, and excited to engage in remote collaboration for a worldwide presence.

We are looking for an experienced Backend Developer with... a strong background in Drupal to join our dynamic team. As a Backend Developer, you will play a crucial role in creating and maintaining our Drupal-based web applications, ensuring their performance, scalability, and security.
Must Have:
• 5+ years of experience with Drupal
• Proficiency in Drupal 9 or 10, including familiarity with the latest updates, features, and improvements introduced in these versions.
• Proficient in Drupal site building and theming using Twig.
• Expertise in Object Oriented PHP/MySQL for seamless integration with Drupal.
• Hands-on experience implementing language translations for multilingual websites.
• Configure content workflows and Drupal forms to optimize site functionality.
• Comfortable writing complex SQL queries as well as utilizing Drupal Entity Queries for data retrieval.
Nice to Have:
• Experience with Acquia Cloud Platform for hosting and managing Drupal applications.
• Familiarity with Acquia Site Studio to build and customize websites with ease.
• Proven track record in custom API integrations and content migrations into Drupal 9/10, enhancing site functionality and user experience.

Benefits & Perks:

- Home office

- Flexible Hours;

- Competitive compensation based on experience;

- Career plans to allow for extensive growth in the company;

- International Projects;

- Oowlish English Program (Improving and Certifying)

- Spanish Classes

- Oowlish fitness with Total Pass;

- Connecting You (Internet allowance);

- Anniversary bonus;

- Wedding gift;

- Pet adoption incentive;

- New baby Owl bonus;

- Back to School bonus;

- Netflix Subscription;

- Oowlish paradise – 4 days/year at a Resort with your family & pets;

- Vacation Bonus;

- Games and Competitions;

- Enjoy your national Holidays;

- Oowlet Store

Come join us in breaking the mold and revolutionizing the tech landscape!

You can also apply here:

