jobs_results.description:
The team of experts providing analytical services to healthcare clients is looking for a great, long-term Senior PHP developer.

You will join an international team of first-class professionals who are passionate about creating products that improve the quality of medical services. 

The company offers exposure to a variety of industries and technologies, room to grow as a professional, time in projects to learn new skills and an opportunity to work with phenomenal coworkers, some of the best people on the planet. 

Responsibilities:
• Creating new endpoints with given data;
• Integrating with other services inside company (microservice pattern);
• Setup and manage ETL processes;
• Supporting existing project (we are live);
• Optimizing/refactoring existing endpoints.

We would be happy if you have: 
• 6+ years of proved PHP development experience (Laravel, REST, Swagger, SOLID); 
• Experience with Microservices, Kubernetes, Elasticsearch and Google Spanner;
• Understanding of ETL... Dataflow and Big Query is a huge bonus;
• English B2 and experience with international product development teams.

Nice to have:
• Experience with Google Cloud services: Spanner, BigQuery, Dataflow \ Cloud Composer etc. (or at least Amazon: S3);
• Experience with Big Data Analytics;
• Experience with other programming languages (e.g Golang);
• Desire to become a teamlead in the future (not mandatory, but is very welcomed).

Benefits:
• Competitive Compensation;
• Completely remote work with an international team of first-class engineers;
• Flexible working hours;
• Interesting projects to work on.

- remote

